{# The privacy policy's paragraph on Leaflet over OpenStreetMap's tiles, included by privacy-policy.en.html.twig when it draws the site's maps (see LeafletProvider) #}
<h3 data-legal-id="third-parties.openstreetmap">Maps (OpenStreetMap)</h3>
<div>
	Maps are drawn from OpenStreetMap's tiles. When a page shows a map, your browser requests them from the OpenStreetMap Foundation's server, which then receives your IP address and the address of the page, without setting any cookie. This data is processed under the <a href="https://osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap Foundation's privacy policy</a>.
</div>
